    "id": "p19-r8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "[Factorials]\n\nLet $f(n)=1\\times2\\times3\\times\\cdots\\times n$. Simplify $\\dfrac{f(n)}{f(n-1)}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$n$.",
      "worked": "The products defining $f(n)$ and $f(n-1)$ have the same factors up to $n-1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{f(n)}{f(n-1)}&=\\frac{f(n-1)\\,n}{f(n-1)}\\\\\\frac{f(n)}{f(n-1)}&=n.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 18
